"the corporation" source code
=============================

a very modified copy of the "baldi's basics open source tool". made for pure performace and system compatibility. 

essentials
-----------------------

all users should be familiar with unity.

* requirements:
	- a good text editor (vs codium, notepad++, vim, emacs, etc)
	- medium knowledge of c# and mathematical algorithims

